cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this package, please cite it. Citing the package does not replace citing the
  OBIS datasets you used; generate those with `OBIS.citations(result)`.
title: "OBIS.jl: a Julia client for the Ocean Biodiversity Information System"
abstract: >-
  A Julia client for the OBIS (Ocean Biodiversity Information System) API, a programme of
  the Intergovernmental Oceanographic Commission of UNESCO. Provides a stable typed schema
  across queries, licence and citation metadata carried on results, streaming and resumable
  pagination, an optional reproducibility cache, and access to absence and dropped records.
type: software
authors:
